  "scope": "Portable source stages survey/power/link for the captured CPH2653 PCIe0/peach selection; the unsupported donor antenna-share supply is removed. The exact 128-write PHY sequence and six rail configurations match the capture. Actual MHI, allocator, PMIC, RDDM, FAT/firmware and bring-up sources run with synthetic peers. A separate explicit cache release API validates ownership and clears buffers after consumers stop; synthetic firmware fixtures now release their caches before reinitialization and exit. Native objects use the pinned Darwin 22 compiler records. Kernel registry/worker, DMA/SMMU ownership, real firmware, MSI and iPhone wireless-framework ABI integration remain open. No foreign wireless frontend or binary binding is imported."
